### UC03 – Cancel Tour Booking (happy path)
# Prerequisite: first create a booking with UC01 and copy the returned bookingId below.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### UC03 – Error: booking not found (404)
# A random UUID that does not exist in the system.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### UC03 – Error: invalid state transition (409)
# Prerequisite: cancel a booking once (UC03 happy path above) and attempt to cancel it again.
# Attempting to cancel an already-CANCELLED (or ACTIVE/COMPLETED) booking triggers InvalidBookingStateException.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}
